    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53813" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάγομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deep-laden,
			heavy-laden</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.43.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμαξαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.34
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>laden with, full of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατοῦ λαφύρων καταγόμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Syr.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευσμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					2.9
				</span></i>
			: also c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπῄεσαν κ. ταῖς ὠφελείαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					31.45
				</span></i>
			.</div>
